    <script type="application/ld+json"> {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "NewsArticle",
    "headline": "BA\u015eKAN HORZUM YEN\u0130 PART\u0130 DEN\u0130ZL\u0130 \u0130L BA\u015eKANLI\u011eINA ADAYLI\u011eINI DEN\u0130ZL\u0130EKSPRES\u0027E A\u00c7IKLADI",
    "name": "BA\u015eKAN HORZUM YEN\u0130 PART\u0130 DEN\u0130ZL\u0130 \u0130L BA\u015eKANLI\u011eINA ADAYLI\u011eINI DEN\u0130ZL\u0130EKSPRES\u0027E A\u00c7IKLADI",
    "inLanguage": "tr-TR",
    "mainEntityOfPage": {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": "https://www.denizliekspres.com.tr/baskan-horzum-yeni-parti-denizli-il-baskanligina-adayligini-denizliekspres-e-acikladi/52796"
    },
    "publisher": {
        "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
        "name": "Denizliekspres",
        "logo": {
            "@type": "ImageObject",
            "url": "https://www.denizliekspres.com.tr/images/generals/logo.png",
            "width": 240,
            "height": 60
        }
    },
    "datePublished": "2026-09-21T08:52:03+03:00",
    "dateModified": "2026-09-21T08:57:42+03:00",
    "description": "BA\u015eKAN HORZUM YEN\u0130 PART\u0130 DEN\u0130ZL\u0130 \u0130L BA\u015eKANLI\u011eINA ADAYLI\u011eINI DEN\u0130ZL\u0130EKSPRES\u0027E A\u00c7IKLADI",
    "articleBody": "Yeni Parti\u2019de kongre s\u00fcreci ba\u015flarken, Denizli\u2019de il\u00e7e kongreleri i\u00e7in haz\u0131rl\u0131klar s\u00fcr\u00fcyor. Yeni Parti Denizli \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Ali Osman Horzum, ekim ay\u0131nda yap\u0131lacak il kongresinde il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na aday oldu\u011funu ilk kez DenizliEkspres\u2019e a\u00e7\u0131klad\u0131.\r\n\r\nYeni Parti\u2019de \u00f6rg\u00fctlerin\u00a0yeniden \u015fekillenece\u011fi kongre s\u00fcreci ba\u015flad\u0131. Denizli\u2019de 19 il\u00e7ede kongre haz\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131 s\u00fcrerken, g\u00f6zler il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 se\u00e7imlerine \u00e7evrildi.\r\n\r\nYeni Parti\u2019nin g\u00fcncel kongre takvimine g\u00f6re il\u00e7e ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u00f6n se\u00e7imleri 26-27 Eyl\u00fcl\u2019de, il\u00e7e kongreleri 3-6 Ekim\u2019de yap\u0131lacak. \u0130l ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in \u00fcyelerin kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek \u00f6n se\u00e7im ise 18 Ekim\u2019de yap\u0131lacak. \u0130l kongrelerinin ise 24-27 Ekim tarihleri aras\u0131nda tamamlanmas\u0131 planlan\u0131yor.\r\n\r\nHORZUM ADAYLI\u011eINI \u0130LK KEZ A\u00c7IKLADI\r\n\r\nYeni Parti Denizli \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Ali Osman Horzum, DenizliEkspres\u2019e yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klamada, il kongresinde yeniden il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na aday oldu\u011funu s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\nHorzum, kongre g\u00fcn\u00fcne kadar ba\u015fka isimlerin de aday olabilece\u011fine dikkat \u00e7ekerek, adayl\u0131k yar\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131n \u00fcyelerin iradesiyle \u015fekillenece\u011fini belirtti.\r\n\r\n\u201cBen il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na aday\u0131m. Kongre g\u00fcn\u00fcne kadar ba\u015fka bir aday da \u00e7\u0131kabilir. \u00c7\u0131karsa da bizim i\u00e7in \u00f6nemli olan \u00fcyelerimizin kendi karar\u0131 ve iradesidir. \u0130l ba\u015fkan\u0131n\u0131 \u00fcyelerimiz se\u00e7ecek\u201d diyen Horzum, Yeni Parti\u2019nin kongre sisteminin di\u011fer siyasi partilerden farkl\u0131 oldu\u011funu vurgulad\u0131.\r\n\r\nDELEGE DE\u011e\u0130L, \u00dcYE BEL\u0130RLEYECEK\r\n\r\nYeni Parti, te\u015fkilat se\u00e7imlerinde \u00fcyelerin do\u011frudan s\u00f6z sahibi olaca\u011f\u0131 bir model uyguluyor. Parti taraf\u0131ndan a\u00e7\u0131klanan g\u00fcncel takvimde de il ba\u015fkan\u0131 ve il\u00e7e ba\u015fkanlar\u0131n\u0131n belirlenmesinde \u00fcye oyunun esas al\u0131naca\u011f\u0131 belirtiliyor.\r\n\r\nDenizli\u2019de yakla\u015f\u0131k 11 bin yeni \u00fcyenin partiye kat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klayan Horzum, daha \u00f6nce yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klamada il\u00e7e ba\u015fkanlar\u0131n\u0131n da \u00fcyelerin oylar\u0131yla belirlenece\u011fini duyurmu\u015ftu.\r\n\r\n\u201cHEDEF\u0130M\u0130Z \u0130KT\u0130DAR\u201d\r\n\r\nHorzum, il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 adayl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klarken Yeni Parti\u2019nin hedefinin iktidar oldu\u011funu da vurgulad\u0131.\r\n\r\n\u201cGenel Ba\u015fkan\u0131m\u0131z \u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel\u2019in liderli\u011finde iktidar olaca\u011f\u0131z\u201d diyen Horzum, Denizli\u2019deki siyasi hedeflerinin de b\u00fcy\u00fck oldu\u011funu s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\nHorzum, daha \u00f6nce yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klamada Denizli i\u00e7in 5 milletvekili hedefi koyduklar\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klam\u0131\u015f, olas\u0131 bir erken se\u00e7ime kar\u015f\u0131 \u00f6rg\u00fct olarak haz\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 s\u00fcrd\u00fcrd\u00fcklerini belirtmi\u015fti.\r\n\r\n5 M\u0130LLETVEK\u0130L\u0130 HEDEF\u0130\r\n\r\nYeni Parti Denizli \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Ali Osman Horzum, genel se\u00e7im haz\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131na ili\u015fkin a\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131nda, \u201cBe\u015f vekil hedefimiz bu\u201d ifadelerini kullanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131.\r\n\r\nHorzum, olas\u0131 bir erken se\u00e7ime kar\u015f\u0131 sand\u0131k g\u00f6revlileri ve se\u00e7im g\u00fcvenli\u011fi konusunda da \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma y\u00fcr\u00fctt\u00fcklerini a\u00e7\u0131klam\u0131\u015ft\u0131.\r\n\r\nYeni Parti\u2019de \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki g\u00fcnlerde il\u00e7e kongreleri tamamlan\u0131rken, 18 Ekim\u2019de yap\u0131lacak il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u00f6n se\u00e7imi ve 24-27 Ekim tarihleri aras\u0131ndaki il kongreleriyle Denizli \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fcn\u00fcn yeni y\u00f6netimi \u015fekillenecek.\r\n\r\nHorzum\u2019un adayl\u0131\u011f\u0131yla birlikte Denizli\u2019de il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 yar\u0131\u015f\u0131 da resmen ba\u015flam\u0131\u015f olacak. Kongre tarihine kadar ba\u015fka isimlerin aday olup olmayaca\u011f\u0131 ise \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki s\u00fcre\u00e7te netle\u015fecek.",
